# Optional: Code Generation Files (Ferry, Injectable, Slang)
# NOTE: It is standard practice in Flutter TO COMMIT your generated files 
# (*.g.dart, *.gql.dart) so your CI/CD pipeline doesn't have to run 
# build_runner. If you prefer to ignore them, uncomment the lines below:
# *.g.dart
# *.gql.dart
# *.req.gql.dart
# *.data.gql.dart
# *.var.gql.dart
# *.schema.gql.dart